flowchart LR
    A[True-news CSV] --> C[Data.ipynb / General.py]
    B[Fake-news CSV] --> C
    C --> D[Dataset.csv\nLabel: 1 true / 0 fake]
    D --> E[Preprocessing.ipynb]
    E --> F[Clean title and article text]
    F --> G[Tokenizer\n25,000-word vocabulary]
    F --> H[Pad title to 100\nPad text to 1,500]
    E --> I[One-hot encode\nsubject/category]
    G --> J[tokenizer.pkl]
    I --> K[encoder.pkl]
    H --> L[processed_data/*.npy]
    L --> M[Model_Traing.ipynb]
    M --> N[Trained Keras model]
    J --> O[Strimlit.py]
    K --> O
    N --> O
    O --> P[True-news score\nFake/true result]

